  "details": "I really feel that it would be nice to have different folders to organize our items because sometimes when we decide to buy things it can become too much to scroll through all of it, and that is also included for stickers and emojis. I would like to be able to organize my items by where they came from or what theme they are including my stickers and emojis. How we would do this is similar to the saved Avatar menu, and then utilize that system and implement it in with the items and or emojis and stickers area. Better organization equals happier people I believe so.",
